<main><div class="eyebrow">Elections / Special Intensive Revision</div><h1>Search the SIR voter list.</h1><p class="intro">Browse available official SIR voter lists by year, constituency and polling station. Search your name or a relative’s name in the original language or English. Use any of the filters to narrow your search.</p>
<p class="small">Coverage varies by year and area. <a id="methodology-link" href="#sir-methodology">Methodology, coverage and disclaimer</a></p>
<section class="panel" id="individual-search"><div class="record-heading"><h2>Find an area or a name</h2><p>Year → State → Parliamentary constituency → Assembly constituency → Polling station. AC selection does not require a PC.</p></div>
<p class="status small">Search in the original script or type the name in English. Results keep the spelling used in the official list.</p>
<form id="record-form" class="filters" method="post" data-manual-submit>
<div><label for="record-year">Year</label><select id="record-year"><option value="">All available years</option></select></div>
<div><label for="record-state">State</label><select id="record-state"><option value="">All available states</option></select></div>
<div><label for="record-pc">Parliamentary constituency (PC)</label><select id="record-pc"><option value="">All available PCs</option></select></div>
<div><label for="record-ac">Assembly constituency (AC)</label><select id="record-ac"><option value="">All available ACs</option></select></div>
<div><label for="record-station">Polling station / part</label><select id="record-station" disabled><option value="">Choose an AC to list stations</option></select></div>
<div><label for="record-edition">Document edition</label><select id="record-edition"><option value="">All available editions</option></select></div>
<div><label for="record-name">Elector name (original script or English)</label><input id="record-name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off"></div>
<div><label for="record-relative">Relative name (original script or English)</label><input id="record-relative" maxlength="100" autocomplete="off"></div>
<div class="filter-actions"><span class="action-label" aria-hidden="true">Search</span><div class="button-row"><button type="submit">Search records</button><button id="record-reset" class="secondary" type="button">Reset filters</button></div><small>Names update automatically as you type.</small><button id="record-retry" class="secondary" type="button" hidden>Try again</button></div>
</form><p id="scope-note" class="status small"></p><p id="record-status" class="status" role="status">Loading choices...</p>
<section id="filtered-summary" class="filtered-summary" hidden><h2>Voters matching your filters</h2><p class="small">Counts update with your selection and include all results pages.</p><div id="gender-summary" class="voter-cards"></div><section class="age-card"><h3>Age distribution</h3><p class="small">Number of matching voters in each age group</p><div id="age-summary" class="age-bars"></div></section></section>
<div id="records-top"></div><div class="table-toolbar"><div><strong>Voter records</strong><span class="small">Names and details from the official list · Scroll sideways for all columns</span></div><div class="page-size"><label for="record-page-size">Rows per page</label><select id="record-page-size"><option value="50">50</option><option value="100">100</option><option value="500">500</option></select></div></div>
<div class="pager"><span id="record-page-info-top" class="small"></span><nav aria-label="Results pages"><button id="record-first-top" disabled aria-label="First page">First</button><button id="record-prev-top" disabled>Previous</button><button id="record-next-top" disabled>Next</button><button id="record-last-top" disabled aria-label="Last page">Last</button></nav></div><div class="table-scroll record-table-scroll"><table class="record-table"><thead><tr><th>Sequence no.</th><th>Elector name</th><th>Relative / relationship</th><th>House no.</th><th>Age</th><th>Gender</th><th>Section / ward</th><th>Voter ID</th><th>Year / edition</th><th>Constituency / polling station</th><th>PDF reference</th></tr></thead><tbody id="record-rows"></tbody></table></div>
<div class="pager"><span id="record-page-info" class="small"></span><nav aria-label="Results pages"><button id="record-first" disabled aria-label="First page">First</button><button id="record-prev" disabled>Previous</button><button id="record-next" disabled>Next</button><button id="record-last" disabled aria-label="Last page">Last</button></nav></div>
<p class="small">For unclear details, check the linked original PDF. <a href="#sir-methodology" onclick="document.getElementById('sir-methodology').open=true">Read the methodology and disclaimer</a>.</p></section>
<details id="sir-methodology" class="methodology"><summary>Methodology, coverage and disclaimer</summary>
<div class="methodology-body"><h2>About these records</h2><p>Only available official electoral-roll editions are listed. Coverage varies by year, constituency and polling part; this is not a complete national register. The filters show the areas and editions currently available.</p>
<p>All entries from the included parts are retained. Names marked “Check original” may be unclear. “Unreadable” means a detail could not be read; “Not published” means it is absent from the source. English searches may also find similar spellings. Open the linked PDF to confirm a name or other details.</p>
<p>The cards and age chart count entries matching your filters, including name searches, across every results page. Each edition is a separate snapshot; the same person may appear in more than one edition. Age groups do not overlap. Missing ages and ages below 18 are shown separately for checking against the source.</p>
<p>Printed totals below cover the available parts only. Each year and list is shown separately. A name search does not change these printed totals. PDF links open the preserved original part file; official publication links identify its source. A draft entry does not confirm current registration.</p>
<div class="source"><a href="https://voters.eci.gov.in/download-eroll" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ECI electoral-roll PDFs</a><a href="https://electoralsearch.eci.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Current voter search on ECI</a></div>
<section class="panel"><div class="record-heading"><h2>Official voter totals by year and part</h2><button type="button" id="statistics-download" disabled>Download totals</button></div><p id="statistics-status" class="status small"></p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Year / edition</th><th>AC / part</th><th>Male</th><th>Female</th><th>Third gender</th><th>Total</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody id="statistics-rows"></tbody></table></div></section>
</div></details>
